  taskPool:
  - taskName: Package Label Check
    briefDescription: Match the package label pattern before it is sent out.
  - taskName: Invoice Review
    briefDescription: Verify the invoice sequence before submitting it.
  - taskName: Order Processing
    briefDescription: Complete the order steps in the correct pattern.
  - taskName: File Sorting
    briefDescription: Follow the filing pattern to organise the documents.
  - taskName: Report Formatting
    briefDescription: Arrange the formatting marks in the correct order.
  - taskName: Data Entry Check
    briefDescription: Confirm the data pattern before saving the entry.
  - taskName: Client Form Review
    briefDescription: Check the client form sequence for missing details.
  - taskName: Meeting Prep
    briefDescription: Follow the preparation pattern before the meeting starts.
  - taskName: Stock Count Check
    briefDescription: Match the stock symbols to complete inventory review.
  - taskName: Email Routing
    briefDescription: Send the request through the correct workflow pattern.
  - taskName: Schedule Update
    briefDescription: Confirm the schedule pattern before updating the calendar.
  - taskName: Receipt Filing
    briefDescription: Arrange the receipt records in the correct sequence.
  - taskName: Portal Upload
    briefDescription: Complete the upload verification pattern.
  - taskName: Quality Check
    briefDescription: Inspect the work pattern before approving the task.
  - taskName: Document Archive
    briefDescription: Follow the archive sequence to store the document.
  easy:
