  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::InboxTriageManager
  gameplayGroups:
  - {fileID: 83516496}
  - {fileID: 315374480}
  - {fileID: 849534724}
  - {fileID: 676197458}
  emailSlots:
  - {fileID: 1068236169}
  - {fileID: 73441935}
  - {fileID: 604258486}
  - {fileID: 857140933}
  - {fileID: 1824169904}
  - {fileID: 1712637247}
  - {fileID: 831986881}
  - {fileID: 123425855}
  resultScoreText: {fileID: 899718758}
  resultDetailsText: {fileID: 1146289687}
  emailNumberText: {fileID: 1394047466}
  emailSenderText: {fileID: 595998835}
  emailContentText: {fileID: 257936279}
  emailTimerText: {fileID: 1923919837}
  emailPool:
  - sender: Ms Tan, Team Lead
    body: Hey! Hope everything is fine. Please be reminded that the meeting with
      our stakeholders has been moved to <mark=#FFFF0077><b>18:30 today</b></mark>
      in Meeting Room 13. Attire will be formal. Please prepare the <color=#FF4B4B><b>final
      slides before the meeting starts</b></color>.
    correctCategory: 0
  - sender: Finance Department
    body: There seems to be a mismatch in the invoice amount submitted under your
      name. Please confirm the correct figure by <mark=#FFFF0077><b>3:00 PM today</b></mark>
      so that the payment can be processed <color=#FF4B4B><b>on time</b></color>.
    correctCategory: 0
  - sender: IT Support
    body: Your account access will expire at <mark=#FFFF0077><b>5:00 PM today</b></mark>
      if the verification is not completed. Please complete the verification through
      the <u>company portal</u> before the deadline.
    correctCategory: 0
  - sender: Project Manager
    body: The weekly report is still missing from the shared folder. Management will
      be reviewing it during the <mark=#FFFF0077><b>11:00 AM meeting</b></mark>,
      so please <color=#FF4B4B><b>upload it as soon as possible</b></color>.
    correctCategory: 0
  - sender: Daniel, Marketing Team
    body: "Hi, could you help to look through the campaign draft <u>when you have
      time</u>? We are collecting everyone\u2019s feedback by <mark=#FFFF0077><b>Friday</b></mark>
      before sending the final version next week."
    correctCategory: 1
  - sender: HR Department
    body: This is a reminder to complete the training feedback form by the <mark=#FFFF0077><b>end
      of the week</b></mark>. It should only take a few minutes, but please submit
      it before the deadline.
    correctCategory: 1
  - sender: Amanda, Client Services
    body: The client asked whether we can provide an updated quotation. Please check
      the latest figures and <color=#4B7BFF><b>reply to them by tomorrow afternoon</b></color>.
    correctCategory: 1
  - sender: Operations Team
    body: Please confirm whether you are available for the inventory check next Monday.
      A <color=#4B7BFF><b>reply by Thursday</b></color> would help us finalise the
      duty roster.
    correctCategory: 1
  - sender: HR Department
    body: Your leave request for next Friday has been <color=#3BA55D><b>approved</b></color>.
      <u>No further action is required</u>, and the updated schedule has already
      been reflected in the system.
    correctCategory: 2
  - sender: Office Admin
    body: "Please note that tomorrow\u2019s department meeting will be held in <mark=#FFFF0077><b>Room
      4B</b></mark> instead of Room 3A. The meeting timing remains <u>unchanged</u>."
    correctCategory: 2
  - sender: Payroll Department
    body: Your payslip for this month is now available in the employee portal. This
      message is <u>for your records only</u> and <color=#3BA55D><b>does not require
      a response</b></color>.
    correctCategory: 2
  - sender: Company Updates
    body: The office will close at <mark=#FFFF0077><b>4:00 PM this Friday</b></mark>
      due to scheduled maintenance. Please plan your work accordingly.
    correctCategory: 2
  - sender: Rewards Centre
    body: Congratulations! You have been selected to receive a <mark=#FFFF0077><b>$500
      shopping voucher</b></mark>. Click the link and enter your <color=#FF4B4B><b>work
      login details</b></color> to claim your prize immediately.
    correctCategory: 3
  - sender: Unknown Sender
    body: Dear user, we have a guaranteed investment plan that can <color=#FF4B4B><b>double
      your money in 24 hours</b></color>. Send your <u>account details</u> now to
      secure this exclusive offer.
    correctCategory: 3
  - sender: Promo Deals
    body: Your mystery package is waiting for confirmation. Pay a <mark=#FFFF0077><b>small
      processing fee</b></mark> now to unlock your surprise delivery before it expires.
    correctCategory: 3
  - sender: Security Alert Team
    body: Your employee account will be deleted unless you verify your <color=#FF4B4B><b>password
      through this external link</b></color> immediately. Failure to respond will
      result in permanent loss of access.
    correctCategory: 3
  - sender: Unknown Sender
    body: "Hi, I\u2019m a new customer who was referred by your sales team. I need
      to confirm the revised quotation before <mark=#FFFF0077><b>4:00 PM today</b></mark>,
      or we may have to delay the order. Please <color=#FF4B4B><b>get back to me
      as soon as possible</b></color>."
    correctCategory: 0
  - sender: Benjamin Wall, Manager
    body: Hello employee. Your salary bonus has been approved. Please click this
      <color=#FF4B4B><b>external link</b></color> and enter your <u>work login password</u>
      to receive the payment immediately.
    correctCategory: 3
  - sender: Office Admin
    body: 'Reminder: the quarerly routine fire alarm test will happen at <mark=#FFFF0077><b>2:00
      PM today</b></mark>. <u>No action is needed from staff</u>, and the test should
      end within 10 minutes.'
    correctCategory: 0
  - sender: Maya, Client Services
    body: Hey, hope your day is going well. When you have a chance, could you check
      the client notes and send me your comments by <mark=#FFFF0077><b>Thursday</b></mark>?
      <u>No rush for today</u>.
    correctCategory: 1
  - sender: IT Helpdask
    body: Your company account has failed security checks. To prevent suspension,
      verify your <color=#FF4B4B><b>password using this non-company link</b></color>
      within the next hour.
    correctCategory: 3
  - sender: Staff Benefits Team
    body: This is a reminder that employees can collect their free lunch voucher
      from the pantry tomorrow. <u>No sign-up is required</u>.
    correctCategory: 2
